# Luxury Motors — visual surfaces

Cards are **elevated surfaces**, not outlined boxes. Buttons keep their existing borders.

## Tokens (`css/tokens.css`)

- `--radius-cards` — all card-like surfaces (not buttons; buttons use `--btn--primary-rounded` / `--radius-buttons`).
- `--shadow-cards` — light backgrounds (white, velo, checkout).
- `--shadow-cards-dark` — dark backgrounds (notte, grafite, carbone, hero banner).

Do not invent new radius/shadow values. Change the token if the look must shift globally.

## Card chrome

```css
/* ✅ card */
border: 0;
border-radius: var(--radius-cards);
box-shadow: var(--shadow-cards); /* or --shadow-cards-dark */

/* ❌ card */
border: 1px solid …;
box-shadow: none; /* rest state */
```

- No 1px ring, no `border-color` hover as the card outline.
- Hairlines **inside** a card (quote divider, totals) are fine.
- Rest state already has depth. Hover may add lift/glow; do not rely on hover for the only shadow.
- `overflow: hidden` when children (photos) must clip to the radius.

## Independent cards

A wrap that groups content is a card. Nested blocks that are their own panels are **separate** cards (own padding, radius, shadow, distinct surface). Do not fuse copy + photo + receipt into one outlined slab.

| Surface | Shadow | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `.checkout-trip`, `.checkout-main`, `.checkout-aside` | `--shadow-cards` | Independent checkout cards; aside is sticky |
| `.confirm-layout` | `--shadow-cards` | Outer confirmation wrap |
| `.confirm-itinerary-copy`, `.confirm-receipt` | `--shadow-cards` | Inner cards on `--color-velo-di-luce` |
| `.view-vehicle-fleet > .wrap` | `--shadow-cards-dark` | Grafite wrap on notte |
| `.banner`, `.fleet-refine` | `--shadow-cards-dark` | Filter banners |
| `.card--fleet` | `--shadow-cards-dark` | Depth at rest |

New listing/checkout panels follow the same pattern: outer wrap card + inner item cards, nested surfaces that contrast (white/velo or grafite/notte).

## Do not

- Strip borders from `.btn` / form controls when restyling cards.
- Put card radius on pills, dots, or full-bleed heroes.
- Duplicate shadow literals in component CSS.
